+## 2. API Contract & Security Invariant Audit
+
+### 2.1 Verified REST Endpoints
+- **Multi-Card Auth:**
+  - `POST /api/v1/admin/auth-cards/test-handshake`
+  - `POST /api/v1/admin/auth-cards/{card_ref}/test-handshake`
+  - `POST /api/v1/admin/auth-cards`
